BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hyroxamsterdamdoubles-w1-s0-easy@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
SUMMARY:Easy run 5 km (talk test)
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 of 10 - Base\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk
  test.\nRe-entry. Madeira's 2\,003 m of descent is an eccentric-damage e
 vent - strength markers return to baseline around day 9 and muscle damag
 e is detectable up to 4 weeks. NO lunges\, NO burpee broad jumps\, NO he
 avy sled this week or next: those are precisely the movements your quads
  cannot absorb yet. Ergs\, grip and technique only. SWIMMING STARTS NOW.
  Swim frequency beats swim volume: 4 x 30-40 min beats 2 x 75\, because 
 fatigue compromises motor learning. Never let a gap exceed 5 days - adul
 t-onset swimmers lose motor patterns fast. Book private lessons NOW for 
 weeks 1-8.\n69 days to HYROX Amsterdam Doubles.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
