UID:hyroxamsterdamdoubles-w3-s0-long@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T134502Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
SUMMARY:Long easy run 10 km
DESCRIPTION:Week 3 of 10 - Base\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk
  test.\nSled introduced at TECHNIQUE load only (50-65%). Your traction p
 hysics: at 56 kg you need 0.81x bodyweight of horizontal force rolling a
 nd 1.03x at a dead start - you are at or past the slip threshold every t
 ime it stops. Learn to never let it stop.\n55 days to HYROX Amsterdam Do
 ubles.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
