DESCRIPTION:Week 5 of 10 - Build\nPriority order from 182k measured doubl
 es teams: running (r=0.90 with finish) > roxzone > lunges/burpees/sled p
 ull. Wall balls correlate r=0.266 - the LOWEST of any segment in doubles
 . Do not spend training on them. Cold immersions start this week and run
  through February - 5-6 short exposures halve the cold-shock response\, 
 which is the mechanism behind most swim DNFs and 90 of 120 recorded sudd
 en deaths in US triathlon.\n40 days to HYROX Amsterdam Doubles.
