SUMMARY:Long easy run 14 km
DESCRIPTION:Week 8 of 10 - Peak\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk
  test.\nROXZONE SESSION this week. Measured: doubles teams get almost no
  transition discount over singles (6:39 vs 7:19 median). An 80-85 team s
 pends 7:29 in roxzone\; the top 10% spend 4:31. That is ~3 minutes avail
 able with zero change in fitness - the cheapest unclaimed time in the fo
 rmat.\n20 days to HYROX Amsterdam Doubles.
